<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Abhijith M. T. | Thermal Energy Storage &amp; Solar Thermal Energy Researcher</title>
<meta name="description" content="Abhijith M. T. — Thermal Energy Storage and Solar Thermal Energy Researcher. Ph.D. in Physics (Green Energy Technology), Pondicherry University. Project Associate at CPRI, Bengaluru.">
<meta name="author" content="Abhijith M. T.">
<meta name="keywords" content="Thermal Energy Storage, Phase Change Materials, Solar Thermal Energy, High Temperature TES, Heat Exchangers, CFD, ANSYS Fluent, CSP, Pondicherry University, CPRI">
<meta property="og:title" content="Abhijith M. T. | Thermal Energy Storage & Solar Thermal Energy Researcher">
<meta property="og:description" content="Researcher in phase change materials, high-temperature thermal energy storage and solar thermal devices. Ph.D., Pondicherry University.">
